{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Mango\u2019s Fisharium</u></strong> is a short incremental game about catching fishes and display it on the Fish Aquarium.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Help Mango to build the biggest and coolest Fisharium ever!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>=== Capture fish in the ocean\u00a0===</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697890/extras/Fish_Capture_Final.gif?t=1745894487\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>=== </strong>Display your fish in the Fisharium<strong>\u00a0===</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697890/extras/aquarium_FINAL.gif?t=1745894487\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>=== </strong>Upgrade your tools\u00a0<strong>\u00a0===</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697890/extras/upgrade_Final.gif?t=1745894487\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10+ fishing locations</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">80+ fish to collect</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All fish have their Shiny version (different color palettes)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Short gameplay (~3 hours of playtime)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Really big and satisfying numbers!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697890/extras/Fish_Move_1.gif?t=1745894487\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/